<title>USA: Insignia Financial Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Insignia Financial Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>INSIGNIA FINANCIAL GROUP, INC.</p>
<p>			     Financial Highlights</p>
<p>						   For the quarter ended</p>
<p>							September 30,</p>
<p>						1996	 1995  % Change</p>
<p> Revenues				$63,987     $31,092   105.8%</p>
<p> EBITDA - Service Division	  10,958	 6,655    64.7%</p>
<p> Combined EBITDA and FFO	    14,307	 8,115    76.3%</p>
<p> Net EBITDA (1)			  9,998	 5,932    68.5%</p>
