<p>(2)  Net EBITDA per common share is net EBITDA divided by the fully diluted weighted average common stock equivalents calculated using the treasury stock method. SOURCE  Insignia Financial Group, Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
